{
  "$comment": [
    "Material graph for the library. build.py runs each node through fixed stages in this order:",
    "load -> tile (rescale | repeat | crop+seam repair, to targets.tileM at the tier's texel density, docs/ART.md \u00a73) -> masks ->",
    "albedo (flatten low frequencies, neutralize, fit the family's ART.md \u00a77.2 median band, soft-limit to the hard limits) ->",
    "roughness -> normal -> ao -> metal -> seam heal -> mips (linear-light base color, renormalized normals with Toksvig",
    "roughness) -> KTX2 -> checks -> library.json. 'target' is the median linear luminance of the untinted base color.",
    "Units: meters. Colors: sRGB hex. 'rooms' use the room ids of src/content/homes.js (apartment)."
  ],
